Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:42.00,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn@DFYanKaiW7-GB\frz270\c&H010000&\3c&HECECEC&\bord3\pos(1142.933,353.822)}阿良川享二
